<title>UK: Panamanian wheat carrier under tow to Azores.</title>
<headline>Panamanian wheat carrier under tow to Azores.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Panamana-flag bulker Mariner C., laden with 53,000 tonnes of wheat, is under tow to the Azores, Lloyd's Shipping Intelligence Service said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The 65,085-dwt vessel has sustained generator damage.</p>
</text>
